# ╔════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
# ║ shared_updated.ttl  ·  static ABox base (semRTI-ODP)                   ║
# ╠════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
# ║ The unchanging part of the graph, merged in memory by semRTI.py.       ║
# ║ Realigned to rupemagna-rti-1_5.ttl (single rpm-rti: namespace,         ║
# ║ CIDOC-CRM/CRMdig alignment, reified AgentRole, Equipment/Software      ║
# ║ split). See changelog.md for the full iter2 → v1.4 design diff.        ║
# ║ v1.5 gap-closure terms now used here: rpm-rti:mtype-physical-diameter  ║
# ║ (dome diameter, via the widened add:hasMeasurementCollection domain)   ║
# ║ and schema:version / foaf:page on chs:Software.                        ║
# ║                                                                        ║
# ║ SECTION MAP                                                            ║
# ║   1 · Prefixes & base                                                  ║
# ║   2 · PART 1 — project-wide resources                                  ║
# ║   3 · PART 2 — figures & dataset series (F01–F11)                      ║
# ║   4 · RTI acquisition method                                           ║
# ╚════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
#
# ABox/data only — TBox lives in rupemagna-rti-1_5.ttl (self-contained profile,
# no owl:imports: CHS-ODP/ArCo/DCAT/DCT/FOAF/GeoWGS84/MUAPIT/ROAPIT/TIAPIT/CRM
# are all inlined there).
#
# NOTE — v1_5 already declares, as NamedIndividuals inside its own TBox file,
# the 6 shared MeasurementUnits (rpm-rti:unit-*) and the 10 shared
# MeasurementTypes (rpm-rti:mtype-*, including the v1.5 addition
# rpm-rti:mtype-physical-diameter), plus the E55 technique individual
# rpm-rti:tech-rti. Those are NOT re-declared here to avoid duplicate/drifting
# assertions — reference them directly by URI from per-session data.

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 1 · PREFIXES & BASE
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf:     <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd:     <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dct:     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .
@prefix foaf:    <http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/> .
@prefix geo:     <http://www.w3.org/2003/01/geo/wgs84_pos#> .
@prefix geosparql: <http://www.opengis.net/ont/geosparql#> .
@prefix schema:  <https://schema.org/> .
@prefix dcat:    <http://www.w3.org/ns/dcat#> .

@prefix chs:     <http://www.ontologydesignpatterns.org/cp/owl/culturalheritagesurvey.owl#> .
@prefix acd:     <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/context-description/> .
@prefix add:     <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/denotative-description/> .
@prefix arco:    <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/arco/> .
@prefix acore:   <https://w3id.org/arco/ontology/core/> .
@prefix muapit:  <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/MU/> .
@prefix roapit:  <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/RO/> .
@prefix tiapit:  <https://w3id.org/italia/onto/TI/> .
@prefix cis:     <http://dati.beniculturali.it/cis/#> .

# --- Single namespace: all former rm- / rm-* resource families gathered
#     under rpm-rti (fragments), matching the ontology's own consolidation.
@prefix rpm-rti: <https://w3id.org/rupemagna-rti/ontology#> .

@base <https://w3id.org/rupemagna-rti/ontology#> .

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# TBox intentionally NOT declared here (T1/T2).
# The embedded owl:Ontology header, the class/object-property/datatype-property/
# annotation-property/datatype re-declarations and the LICENSE NamedIndividual
# were removed: the schema lives entirely in rupemagna-rti-1.4.ttl (own terms,
# CHS-ODP/ArCo/DCAT/DCT/FOAF/GeoWGS84/MUAPIT/ROAPIT/TIAPIT/CRM all inlined —
# no owl:imports to chase). The retired inverse-direction survey property was
# dropped too (data uses acd:isSurveyOn, not chs:isSurveyOn, per v1.4).
# shared_updated.ttl carries ABox/data only; the @prefix block + @base above
# remain for it.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 2 · PART 1  ·  project-wide resources
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#   Project · Scope · Site · Agent · Roles · Equipment (Hardware + Software)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A.1 — Cultural Heritage Project  [ODP: chs:CulturalHeritageProject]
#        Top-level container for all 40 RTI sessions at Rupe Magna.
#        Per-session chs:CulturalHeritageSurvey / rpm-rti:RTISurvey individuals
#        (one per RTI-01 … RTI-40) are asserted in construct-dataset.sparql,
#        each with its own acd:isSurveyOn target and acore:hasAgentRole —
#        NOT declared here.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rpm-rti:project-rupe-magna
    a owl:NamedIndividual, chs:CulturalHeritageProject ;
    dct:creator rpm-rti:agent-huseyin-erdogan ;
    dct:license <LICENSE_URL_PLACEHOLDER> ;
    dct:description "RTI photographic survey project documenting the rock art engravings at Rupe Magna (Grosio, Lombardy, Italy). Conducted September 2025 by Hüseyin Erdoğan (Università di Bologna). 40 acquisition sessions across 11 rock art figures using a custom-built portable RTI dome."@en ;
    chs:hasSpaceScope rpm-rti:scope-rupe-magna-space ;
    chs:hasTemporalScope rpm-rti:scope-rupe-magna-time ;
    rdfs:label "Rupe Magna Project"@en .

rpm-rti:scope-rupe-magna-space
    # acore:Location materialised alongside chs:SpaceProjectScope (its declared
    # superclass) so the CRM-alignment class is directly queryable without a
    # reasoner — same treatment applied throughout this file's A.1-A.4 block.
    a owl:NamedIndividual, chs:SpaceProjectScope, acore:Location ;
    rdfs:label "Rupe Magna, Grosio, Lombardy, Italy"@en .

rpm-rti:scope-rupe-magna-time
    a owl:NamedIndividual, tiapit:TimeInterval, chs:TemporalScope ;
    tiapit:startTime "2025-09-01"^^xsd:date ;
    tiapit:endTime "2025-09-30"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:label "September 2025 acquisition campaign"@en .


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A.2 — Archaeological site  [ODP: chs:CulturalProperty via arco:ArchaeologicalProperty]
#        v1.4 merges the former separate "park" individual (rm:rupe-magna_park,
#        cis:ArcheologicalPark) into the site itself: one individual, multiply
#        typed as arco:ArchaeologicalProperty, arco:ArchaeologicalPark and the
#        CRM-aligned rpm-rti:RockArtSite (⊑ crm:E27_Site).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rpm-rti:site-rupe-magna
    # chs:CulturalProperty + chs:FeatureOfInterest materialised alongside
    # arco:ArchaeologicalProperty (its declared superclasses per the ontology's
    # "central bridge" comment) rather than left to subclass reasoning.
    a owl:NamedIndividual, arco:ArchaeologicalProperty, arco:ArchaeologicalPark,
        rpm-rti:RockArtSite, chs:CulturalProperty, chs:FeatureOfInterest ;
    owl:sameAs <https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q21234614> ;
    # geo (lat/long/alt) + address (locality/region/country) are injected at
    # build time from enrich-metadata.json (see _metadata_ttl in semRTI.py).
    dct:description "Parco delle Incisioni Rupestri di Grosio — approximately 84 × 35 metres of alpine rock art surface in Upper Valtellina, Northern Italy, featuring over 5,454 petroglyphs spanning the Bronze and Iron Ages."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Rupe Magna Rock Art Site"@en .


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A.3 — Author / Agent
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rpm-rti:agent-huseyin-erdogan
    a owl:NamedIndividual, foaf:Person, acore:Agent .
    # name, email (mbox), orcid, affiliation, jobTitle are injected at build time
    # from enrich-metadata.json (see _metadata_ttl in semRTI.py) — single source.


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A.3b — Role vocabulary  [ODP: roapit:Role via rpm-rti:PhotographerRole / AnalystRole]
#        Shared role-type individuals, reused by every per-session
#        acore:AgentRole (rpm-rti:role-{sessionID}-photographer / -analyst,
#        asserted in construct-dataset.sparql) via roapit:withRole.
#        v1.4 replaces the old bare-string roapit:withRole datatype property
#        and the external ArCo/dati.cultura.gov.it Role URIs with these two
#        locally-typed object-property targets.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rpm-rti:role-photographer
    a owl:NamedIndividual, rpm-rti:PhotographerRole ;
    rdfs:label "Photographer"@en .

rpm-rti:role-analyst
    a owl:NamedIndividual, rpm-rti:AnalystRole ;
    rdfs:label "Analyst"@en .


# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# A.4 — Equipment  [ODP: chs:Hardware / chs:Software, both subclasses of chs:Equipment]
#        Hardware: two shared instances referenced by every EquipmentConfiguration.
#        Software: v1.4 adds chs:Software (⊑ crmdig:D14_Software) for the
#        processing tools used downstream of acquisition (RAWDevelopment,
#        RTIFitting/RTIExport).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rpm-rti:equip-rti-dome
    # chs:Equipment materialised alongside chs:Hardware (its declared superclass).
    a owl:NamedIndividual, chs:Hardware, chs:Equipment ;
    # v1.4 scopes schema:numberOfItems to dcat:Distribution only (48 JPEG/RAF files,
    # 1 PTM/HSH file) — dropped here in favour of the dome's own description, since
    # it is not itself a Distribution. schema:width is not a profiled annotation
    # property (pixel-typed in v1.5, not a physical length). The 460 mm diameter is
    # instead carried as a structured measurement below, via the v1.5 widening of
    # add:hasMeasurementCollection to chs:Equipment + rpm-rti:mtype-physical-diameter.
    dct:description "Portable hemispherical RTI dome designed and built by Hüseyin Erdoğan (2021, revised 2024). Aluminium shell, 460 mm diameter, 48-LED array across 6 elevation tiers (8 LEDs per tier, angular coverage ~9°–60°). Powered by a 5V portable power bank. Deployed at Rupe Magna in September 2025."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Custom-Built Portable RTI Dome"@en ;
    add:hasMeasurementCollection rpm-rti:mcoll-rti-dome .

rpm-rti:mcoll-rti-dome
    a owl:NamedIndividual, add:MeasurementCollection ;
    add:hasMeasurement rpm-rti:meas-rti-dome-diameter ;
    rdfs:label "RTI dome physical measurements"@en .

rpm-rti:meas-rti-dome-diameter
    a owl:NamedIndividual, add:Measurement ;
    add:measurementType rpm-rti:mtype-physical-diameter ;
    muapit:hasMeasurementUnit rpm-rti:unit-millimetre ;
    muapit:value 460 ;
    rdfs:label "RTI dome diameter — 460 mm"@en .

rpm-rti:equip-fujifilm-xs20
    a owl:NamedIndividual, chs:Hardware, chs:Equipment ;
    schema:brand "Fujifilm" ;
    schema:model "X-S20" ;
    dct:description "APS-C mirrorless camera body. Used with Fujifilm XF 16–55 mm f/2.8 R LM WR lens. Operated in manual exposure mode throughout all RTI acquisition sessions."@en ;
    rdfs:label "Fujifilm X-S20 Mirrorless Camera"@en .

rpm-rti:software-darktable
    # chs:Equipment materialised alongside chs:Software (its declared superclass).
    a owl:NamedIndividual, chs:Software, chs:Equipment ;
    schema:model "darktable 5.4.1" ;
    dct:description "Open-source RAW photo processing software used to uniformly develop the 48-image RAW multi-light set into the JPEG stack (rpm-rti:RAWDevelopment). Images exported as linear JPEG."@en ;
    rdfs:label "darktable"@en .

rpm-rti:software-relightlab
    a owl:NamedIndividual, chs:Software, chs:Equipment ;
    dct:description "RTI processing software used for per-pixel reflectance fitting (sphere detection, light-direction recovery, registration, crop, offset) and export to the delivery format (rpm-rti:RTIFitting, rpm-rti:RTIExport)."@en ;
    # version + homepage newly profiled in v1.5 (schema:version domain chs:Software,
    # foaf:page domain chs:Equipment) — previously present in the generated KG with
    # no home in the TBox.
    schema:version "2026.03" ;
    foaf:page <https://vcg.isti.cnr.it/relight/> ;
    rdfs:label "RelightLab"@en .


# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# 3 · PART 2  ·  figures & dataset series (F01–F11)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# F01 — Sector AA — The Praying Figure with Spiral
# Sessions: RTI-01 – RTI-10  (10 sessions)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

rpm-rti:fig-F01
    a owl:NamedIndividual, arco:ArchaeologicalProperty, rpm-rti:RockArtFigure,
        chs:CulturalProperty, chs:FeatureOfInterest ;
    arco:isPartOf rpm-rti:site-rupe-magna ;
    dct:identifier "F01" ;
    dct:description "Rock art figure in Sector AA at Rupe Magna Rock Art Site. Depicts a praying human figure with a spiral motif."@en ;
    rdfs:label "The Praying Figure with Spiral (F01) — Sector AA"@en .

rpm-rti:series-F01
    a owl:NamedIndividual, dcat:DatasetSeries ;
    dct:creator rpm-rti:agent-huseyin-erdogan ;
    dct:license <LICENSE_URL_PLACEHOLDER> ;
    dct:description "All RTI photographic datasets documenting figure F01 (The Praying Figure with Spiral), Sector AA, at Rupe Magna Rock Art Site, Grosio, Italy. 10 acquisition sessions."@en ;
    dct:title "F01 RTI Dataset Series — The Praying Figure with Spiral, Rupe Magna"@en .


